('What is the average-case time complexity of search, insert, and delete in a hash table with a good hash function and low load factor?', '["O(1)","O(log n)","O(n)","O(n log n)"]'::jsonb, 0, 'dsa', 'easy', true),
('What is the worst-case time complexity of a search operation in a hash table due to collisions?', '["O(1)","O(log n)","O(n)","O(n log n)"]'::jsonb, 2, 'dsa', 'medium', true),
('What is a hash collision?', '["When two different keys map to the same index in the hash table","When a hash table is completely full","When the hash function returns a negative value","When a key is deleted from the hash table"]'::jsonb, 0, 'dsa', 'easy', true),
