('What is the load factor of a hash table?', '["The number of buckets divided by the number of elements","The number of elements divided by the number of buckets","The maximum key value in the table","The number of collisions that have occurred"]'::jsonb, 1, 'dsa', 'easy', true),
('In open addressing, what problem does linear probing suffer from, where long runs of occupied slots tend to form?', '["Secondary clustering","Primary clustering","Perfect hashing failure","Load factor overflow"]'::jsonb, 1, 'dsa', 'hard', true);
